ho gaya shaheed akbar-e-jawa<br>
sar ko peet kar keh rahi hai maa<br>
<br>
1. jayein to kidhar ghamzada hussain<br>
ho kaha pe tum mere noor-e-ain<br>
pyaas se nazar hai dhuva dhuvan (2 times)<br>
<br>
2. reg-e-garm par arz-e-karbala<br>
ediya ragadta hain mai laqa<br>
seena-e-pisar se hain khoon rava (2 times)<br>
<br>
3. yousuf-e-hussain tha woh mai laqa<br>
margaya woh hum shakl-e-mustafa<br>
khavi qalb par zulm ki sina (2 times)<br>
<br>
4. paal kar jawaan tha jise kiya<br>
uske byah ka gham hi rahgaya<br>
roke kar rahi hain phuphi baya (2 times)<br>
<br>
5. noojawan hain khoon mein tarbatar<br>
kis tarah uthe laasha-e-pisar<br>
hain hussain par saqt imteha (2 times)<br>
<br>
6. maa ke bain se hashr hai bapa<br>
qaak udati hai arz-e-kabala<br>
qoo rolayega ab yeh aasmaa (2 times)<br>
<br>
7. tere qal-o-qat yaad ayengey<br>
maa ko umr bhar khoo rolayeney<br>
royegi tujhe umr bhar yeh maa (2 times)<br>
<br>
8. sogwar hai sadiq-e-hazi<br>
maa-o-mehar sab aur falak zamee<br>
haye margaya akbar-e-jawaan